r dated 06.01.2022 passed by the Chairperson of Authority, the present case was entrusted to the Bench of Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Ld. Member of the Authority. The parties were directed to appear before the Bench of Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Ld. Member of Authority on 01.02.2022 at 11.00 AM. ','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,1,1,2,'legaladvrera','2022-02-03 11:24:05.000','legaladvrera','2022-02-03 11:24:05.000'),(386,4,'TR',2022,'GCNo03672021TR',2671,'GCNo03672021TR-AO02642021','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2022-02-03 00:00:00.000','1205','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','1204','Sh. Sanjiv Gupta, Member','Transfer Case To Authority','As per Complainant\'s request through email dated 12.12.2021, the present case is converted from Form N to Form M','','','0','','',1,0,'',1,0,0,0,1,2,'amlegalrera','2022-02-03 11:47:52.000','amlegalrera','2022-02-03 11:47:52.000'),(387,5,'TR',2022,'GCNo17682020BFTR',2894,'GCNo17682020BF','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2022-02-21 00:00:00.000','1205','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','1204','Sh. Sanjiv Gupta, Member','','The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 03.01.2022 had directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the Bench of Sh, Sanjiv Gupta, Ld. Member of the Authority for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant. ','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,1,1,2,'legaladvrera','2022-02-21 03:40:24.000','legaladvrera','2022-02-21 03:40:24.000'),(388,6,'TR',2022,'GCNo11752019BFTR',2898,'GCNo11752019BF','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2022-02-21 00:00:00.000','1205','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','1203','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','','\r\nThe Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 04.01.2022 directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the Bench of Chairperson of Authority for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,1,1,2,'legaladvrera','2022-02-21 03:53:59.000','legaladvrera','2022-02-21 03:53:59.000'),(389,7,'TR